%% .github/workflows/visual-docs.yml. Full notes: docs/system-flow.md.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> pending: POST /api/jobs
  pending --> processing: worker picks oldest (every 5 s)
  processing --> pending: stuck over 10 min, reset
  processing --> failed: Ollama error or timeout
  failed --> pending: retry (under 3 tries, after 60 s)
  failed --> review_failed: 3rd failure
  processing --> review_failed: no tapes detected
  processing --> review_pending: 1+ tapes found, OMDb-enriched
  review_failed --> [*]: failed card in Review
  review_pending --> [*]: one card per tape in Review
